{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24797","headline":"唐昌观玉蘂花折有仙人游怅然成二绝 一 · 严休复","name":"唐昌观玉蘂花折有仙人游怅然成二绝 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"终日斋心祷玉宸，魂销目断未逢真。\n不如满树琼瑶蘂，笑对藏花洞里人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严休复","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24797.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24797","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}